d stexpectcr. Expected cumulative incidence allowing for the competing risk of death
d Ederer I, Ederer II (conditional, allows late entry) and Hakulinen methods; companion to stexpect.
d Requires Stata 14 or later, stset data with an id() variable, and two reference rates
d (event incidence rate and all-cause mortality rate) merged onto the split records.
d Author: Raoul Reulen
